<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Service cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Service cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded National Service Industries Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock has neared Salomon's $46 price target.</p>
<p>-- said believes the shares are fairly valued at 17 times estimated 1998 earnings of $2.55 per share.</p>
<p>-- said expects the stock to be a &quot;market performer&quot; for the rest of 1997.</p>
<p>-- said is optimistic about all aspects of the diversified services company.</p>
<p>-- National Service lost 1/8 to 44-3/8.</p>
